      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "F3A81DA8F42150A1",
      "text": "在我那個年代，說到圖鑑\\n可是得手寫在筆記本上的呢。\\r\\n現在的時代真是令人振奮啊。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_17",
      "hash64": "DE914174D9A253A8",
      "text": "手寫圖鑑未免也太辛苦了！\\n我根本沒辦法想像！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "F3A81CA8F4214EEE",
      "text": "呵呵……\\n我想也是。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "F3A817A8F421466F",
      "text": "不過，即使時代變了，\\n與寶可夢相遇的那份美好感動\\r\\n是不論何時都不會褪色的。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "F3A816A8F42144BC",
      "text": "我相信與寶可夢的相遇越多，\\n為兩位帶來的成長也就會越大。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "F3A499A8F41E3A7E",
      "text": "請以完成圖鑑為目標，\\n好好加油吧。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "F3A49AA8F41E3C31",
      "text": "我還有事要與\\n妮莫同學的家人談談。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "F3A497A8F41E3718",
      "text": "要是妮莫同學妳能夠\\n帶[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學到學院，\\r\\n我會非常感激……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_18",
      "hash64": "DE914074D9A251F5",
      "text": "那當然了！\\n請包在我身上！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "F3A498A8F41E38CB",
      "text": "我知道妳很可靠的。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "F3A49DA8F41E414A",
      "text": "那麼，\\n你跟我一起來吧。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "common_0090_grass_01",
      "hash64": "338D44F432726C51",
      "text": "耶喵。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "common_0090_fire_01",
      "hash64": "2F5177941C3E097D",
      "text": "呆呃～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "common_0090_water_01",
      "hash64": "31E21113DA8970FA",
      "text": "潤！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_19",
      "hash64": "DE913F74D9A25042",
      "text": "也許不只是對戰，我應該\\n要稍微加把勁填圖鑑才是。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_20",
      "hash64": "DE94AE74D9A542B6",
      "text": "……說到圖鑑！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_21",
      "hash64": "DE94AF74D9A54469",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳還沒有捉過野生的寶可夢吧！？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
